  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the pig as a symbol of moral decay",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the pig in the bottom half of the meme, which serves as the target of the meme's degrading metaphor. The text 'if we don't start watching what we eat' directly addresses the viewer ('we'), implying that the user's own dietary choices are being judged and that they are at risk of becoming like the pig. The pig is the visual embodiment of the consequence described, and the user is projected onto this entity as the potential future state if they fail to change their behavior.",
